      "message": "fix(ui): frame the opened document so the orbit pivot is on the part\n\nThe work envelope (#1567, c0b4dfc85) never reaches Camera::target: it is\noverlay lines only, and State::frame_all reads part and stock facets,\nfixtures and WCS origins. The pivot the maintainer saw was the target an\nopen left in place: reset_for_open kept the old document's camera (or the\ndefault target at the world origin), and the envelope drawn about the work\norigin made the orbit look as if it turned about the envelope.\n\nreset_for_open now frames the new document, as the F key does, for the\ndisk and the browser-bytes open. Pinned with the envelope display on and\noff after frame and after open; the readings are equal and lie on the\npart and stock.\n\nFixes #1997\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
